  "reference": "2 Sam. 17",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋirwa a ŋidi, tema Aisopel neni ka Abusalom, “Kimyekinae ayoŋ oseu ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomon ka ŋaarei, ido nai orotok akiwarit Daudi takae nakwaare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiiryakini ayoŋ iŋes eriŋa eupit ka ekadanakinit. Etuumikini ayoŋ iŋes etubul, ido toema ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu erukitotor iŋes. Aari ayoŋ erwosit bon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido enyaku neni kon ŋituŋa ŋuluce daadaŋ. Eruwor atwanare a Daudi aboŋun a ŋituŋa a ŋuluce daadaŋ neni kon. Mam nyawani ayoŋ ŋituŋa ŋuluce daadaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitalakasi ŋakiro ka Aisopel Abusalom ka ŋikasikou a Ŋisirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋakiro a Usai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Abusalom, “Tonyarautu Usai daŋ Earikait laalo, ido eirasi ŋuna elimuni iŋes daŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ebuni Usai neni ka Abusalom, tema Abusalom neni keŋ, “Adau Aisopel alimun ŋakiro nu, ikitiyae ikwapei alimunio iŋes a? Ani kemam, tolimokinae isua.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Usai neni ka Abusalom, “Nyejokak apaki na ŋakiro ŋuna adau Aisopel alimun.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Torubak Usai irworo tema, “Iyeni robo ca iyoŋ atemar ejioko papa kon ka ŋikilyok ŋulu erukitotor. Ededeŋ ikes ikote aŋatuny anariet ŋina edemaritae ŋitak keŋ. Nabo daŋ, eyeni papa kon ejie nooi; nyeperi iŋes neni epereneneete ŋasigarya keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari tokona daŋ eŋopit iŋes anaturukan, kori anakibois ka ace. Ani kisyak iŋes akitijikin ŋajorei kon, toar, elimunete ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu iirarete ŋakiro ŋun ebe, ‘Aari ŋajorei ŋuna ka Abusalom.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi nai tari ekile ŋolo ededeŋ anajore kon, ŋolo eryenyaana alotau ikwa eŋatuny, emini ekabule tomaranik, anerae eyenete Ŋisirael daadaŋ atemar erae papa kon ekajion ka ededeŋ ŋikilyok ŋulu erukitotor iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ŋuna alimuni ayoŋ ikes nu, ‘Emaikina tocunakinos Ŋisirael daadaŋ neni kon ameun alo Dan tari Beeriseba. Emaikina ikes elalak nooi ikwa asinyon alokipetot ka anam. Emaikina iyoŋ elope torik ikes iyai lojie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, ikwaŋunio iwon Daudi anakibois a daadaŋ ikwaŋunere iwon iŋes. Etuumikisi iŋes, oburusiyasi lopite ŋolo eburusiyaryata ŋakopi akwap. Emam epite ŋolo ebucaror iŋes, kori ekile edio ŋolo erukitotor iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kelot iŋes lotaun, eyaunete Ŋisirael daadaŋ ŋaunoi lotaun ŋol, kibwatarae etaun nakadipaalat akitodol neni emunyumunyaaror todaun ibore ipei daŋ.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Temasi Abusalom ka Ŋisirael daadaŋ, “Iyookino ŋakiro ŋuna alimu Usai Earikait akilo ŋuna ka Aisopel.” Alimunete ikes ŋun, anerae pa acamit Ekapolon kiyookinos ŋakiro ŋuna ajokak ŋuna alimunit Aisopel, ikotere Ekapolon isicani Abusalom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Usai Daudi akisi iwace",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Usai neni a ŋisacaradotin Sadok ka Abiasar, “Adau Aisopel alimokin Abusalom ka ŋikasikou a Ŋisirael akitiya ŋakiro nu ka nu, nai alimok ayoŋ iŋes akitiya nu ka nu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiyasi akirot atipei tolimokis Daudi ebe, ‘Nyipero lolo nakwaare lodoketa a ŋayona a ŋuna analoŋisat, totuboros a nen atipei nyiŋodiŋoda, acepaki emunyaryo erwosit kaapei ka ŋirukitos keŋ daadaŋ a nen.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin awuasi Yonasan ka Aimas alocowa a ŋolo enyaritae Rogel, aya ikes nen, anerae pa acamakinito ikes idiotuŋanan kiŋolik ikes elomarete lotaun. Aŋun, eyakiyanaryo apese ŋina arae apito neni kec, ido toloto ikes alimokin erwosit Daudi ŋakiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai kebu esorokit epei kiŋolik ikes, ido tolot tolimok Abusalom. Aŋun, apotu ikes ŋuluarei ŋul torotokis a nen atipei toloto kai ke ekile ke ece a ŋolo alo Baurim. Ayakar ekile ŋol akare keŋ lore keŋ, ido apotu Aimas ka Yonasan todokasi kare ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolemu aberu a ekile a ŋol ibore, ya torapak nakituk a akare, ido tolok ŋikinyom kidiama arapet ŋin. Mam ituŋanan a nen ayeni ŋakiro ŋun ipei daŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani epote ŋirukitos ka Abusalom kai ka aberu a ŋin, kiŋita ikes temasi, “Ai eyakasi Aimas ka Yonasan?” Toboŋok aberu ŋin ikes tema, “Apotu todokasi ekekwaye ayonae.” Tosaka ŋikilyok ŋul Aimas ka Yonasan nen, nai apotu nyeryamut; aŋun, apotu toboŋosi Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kerotokis ŋikilyok ŋul, todokut Aimas ka Yonasan alokare, toloto tolimokis Daudi ŋakiro ŋuna eyakitere ikes. Temasi, “Torotok, todoka ekekwaye aŋolol Yorodan atipei, anerae adau Aisopel alimokin Abusalom ŋakiro nu ka nu ŋuna nyejokak aŋuna kon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu Daudi ka ŋituŋa ŋulu arukitotor iŋes daadaŋ torotokis, todokasi ekekwaye Yorodan. Ani iwalari akwap, aris ŋituŋa daadaŋ kedokasi ekekwaye Yorodan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eyenuni Aisopel atemar mam ituŋanan abu kiwuap ŋakiro keŋ, abu toenik esigirya keŋ toboŋo kai keŋ lotaun kec. Kitemok ŋiboro alokai keŋ, ido tomyedakin. Ani kedau iŋes atwanare, aponi yaarae akuwan keŋ tonukae neni anukitae papa keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoluni Daudi Maanaim, todokarete Abusalom ka ŋikilyok ŋulu a Isirael daadaŋ ekekwaye Yorodan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, keris Abusalom keseu Amasa apolokin ŋasigarya keŋ, kilunyokin lorot a Yoab. Arae Amasa lokoku ke ekile a ŋolo anyaritae Isira a ŋolo arae Esiraelit, ŋolo eisit Abigail nakoku a Naas, ido arae Abigail nakaato keŋ a Seruia a toto a Yoab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
