        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoluni Daudi Maanaim, apotu Sobi lokoku a Naas a ŋolo alo Raba alotaun a ŋolo alo Lodebar ta Barisilai ŋolo alo Gilead, ŋolo abuni aneni enyaritae Rogelim, ",
          "type": "text",
