          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaut neni keŋ ŋiboro ŋuluperyet ka ŋabapwa ta ŋiboro ŋulukimujet ŋulu etiyaunitae ke elupe. Apotu daŋ ikes yaut ŋaganoi, ŋikinyom ŋulu ikwaan ka erau, ŋakirya, ŋikinyom ŋulu iwowatae ka ŋimare ta emaret ŋolo enyaritae ekao. ",
          "type": "text",
